      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchada 'kiymoq' deyarli hamma narsaga ishlatiladi, faqat soat, uzuk va ko'zoynakni 'taqmoq' deymiz. Koreyschada esa tananing qismiga qarab fe'l tanlanadi. Eslab qolish uchun: tana — 입다, oyoq — 신다, bosh — 쓰다, barmoq — 끼다, bilak — 차다.",
      "compare_en": "English says 'wear' or 'put on' for everything: clothes, shoes, a hat, glasses, a ring, a watch. Korean picks the verb by body part. To remember: body — 입다, feet — 신다, head — 쓰다, fingers — 끼다, wrist — 차다."
