        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "이건 잘 맞아요. 얼마예요?",
        "uz": "Bu to'g'ri keldi. Qancha turadi?",
        "en": "This one fits. How much is it?",
        "audio": "947c6bc7bcf3.mp3"
